GitHub Actions + Slack CLI

แนวทางที่เหมาะคือทำเป็น reusable workflow สำหรับส่งสถานะ GitHub Actions ไปยัง Slack โดยให้ slackcli ทำหน้าที่เป็น notification layer และไม่เอา Slack token ไป hard-code ใน YAML

A clean architecture is:

GitHub Actions
      │
      ├── build
      ├── test
      ├── lint
      └── deploy
            │
            ▼
      Slack CLI wrapper
            │
            ▼
          Slack

1. .github/workflows/slack-notify.yml

name: Slack Notification

on:
  workflow_run:
    workflows:
      - CI
      - Deploy
      - Release
    types:
      - completed

permissions:
  contents: read

jobs:
  notify:
    name: Notify Slack
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - name: Checkout
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Install Slack CLI
        shell: bash
        run: |
          curl -fsSL https://downloads.slack-edge.com/slack-cli/install.sh | bash
          echo "$HOME/.slack/bin" >> "$GITHUB_PATH"

      - name: Prepare status
        id: status
        shell: bash
        run: |
          if [ "${{ github.event.workflow_run.conclusion }}" = "success" ]; then
            echo "status=SUCCESS" >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"
            echo "emoji=✅" >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"
          elif [ "${{ github.event.workflow_run.conclusion }}" = "failure" ]; then
            echo "status=FAILED" >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"
            echo "emoji=❌" >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"
          else
            echo "status=${{ github.event.workflow_run.conclusion }}" >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"
            echo "emoji=⚠️" >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"
          fi

      - name: Send Slack notification
        env:
          SLACK_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.SLACK_TOKEN }}
          SLACK_CHANNEL: ${{ secrets.SLACK_CHANNEL }}
          WORKFLOW_NAME: ${{ github.event.workflow_run.name }}
          WORKFLOW_STATUS: ${{ steps.status.outputs.status }}
          WORKFLOW_EMOJI: ${{ steps.status.outputs.emoji }}
          RUN_URL: ${{ github.event.workflow_run.html_url }}
          BRANCH: ${{ github.event.workflow_run.head_branch }}
          ACTOR: ${{ github.event.workflow_run.actor.login }}
        run: |
          MESSAGE="${WORKFLOW_EMOJI} *${WORKFLOW_NAME}* — ${WORKFLOW_STATUS}

          Branch: \`${BRANCH}\`
          Actor: \`${ACTOR}\`
          <${RUN_URL}|View GitHub Actions run>"

          slack chat send \
            --channel "$SLACK_CHANNEL" \
            --text "$MESSAGE"

2. Better production structure

สำหรับหลาย repository เช่น new-crystalcastle และ crystalcastleX ผมแนะนำแยก notification logic เป็น reusable workflow:

.github/
└── workflows/
    ├── ci.yml
    ├── test.yml
    ├── security.yml
    ├── deploy.yml
    ├── release.yml
    ├── slack-notify.yml
    └── reusable-slack.yml

ตัว workflow หลักจะส่ง event เข้า reusable workflow:

jobs:
  slack:
    uses: ZyntroAI/.github/.github/workflows/reusable-slack.yml@main
    secrets: inherit

แล้วให้ centralized workflow จัดการ:

CI
 ├─ success ──┐
 ├─ failure ──┤
 └─ cancelled ─┤
               ▼
        reusable-slack.yml
               │
               ▼
             Slack

